    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_nsdr_600_0",
      "text": "找个可以躺稳的位置，把身体交给床面或垫子。接下来，跟着声音休息。",
      "windowSeconds": 30,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 0,
      "endSeconds": 30,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 7.51,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_nsdr_600_0.m4a",
      "sha256": "e151dd502afe3fbd03ccb17d90cccd64003c0bb75bff0acfa464a544d116f253",
      "postEncodeGainDB": 0.23000000000000043
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_nsdr_600_1",
      "text": "轻轻闭眼，或把视线放低。你不用一直看屏幕。",
      "windowSeconds": 30,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 30,
      "endSeconds": 60,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 5.5,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_nsdr_600_1.m4a",
      "sha256": "adc71ccf770173f01d9d4e0e1687cc044019f71f85d44f2604af67db89608d10",
      "postEncodeGainDB": 0
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_nsdr_600_2",
      "text": "松开眼周，让下颌和舌头都轻松一点。",
      "windowSeconds": 30,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 60,
      "endSeconds": 90,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 4.516009,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_nsdr_600_2.m4a",
      "sha256": "fea94efabf656daf94043adc0c8082f40060e7834cb3186b7b6e8f5a5ca2a718",
      "postEncodeGainDB": 0.48999999999999844
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_nsdr_600_3",
      "text": "让两侧肩膀落下来。背部的重量，交给下面的支撑。",
      "windowSeconds": 40,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 90,
      "endSeconds": 130,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 5.9,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_nsdr_600_3.m4a",
      "sha256": "8c41e36e2c19c1cf292ae3ae9b6a6100a86480d30c86da9881418d45bc1c48b0",
      "postEncodeGainDB": 0
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_nsdr_600_4",
      "text": "注意上臂、前臂，再到双手。让手指自然弯着。",
      "windowSeconds": 40,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 130,
      "endSeconds": 170,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 5.7,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_nsdr_600_4.m4a",
      "sha256": "42104d11da37ee316ba34dc24f041e1980a704e78fe9ae035e6397572419c629",
      "postEncodeGainDB": -0.6000000000000014
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_nsdr_600_5",
      "text": "感受手掌的重量。现在不用抓住任何东西。",
      "windowSeconds": 40,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 170,
      "endSeconds": 210,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 4.900998,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_nsdr_600_5.m4a",
      "sha256": "5d80a85c231d1b14fe94b7691ea7e7238e0ced703e520ff575a14e44dd133797",
      "postEncodeGainDB": -0.2699999999999996
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_nsdr_600_6",
      "text": "留意一口自然呼吸。让空气自己进来，再出去。",
      "windowSeconds": 40,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 210,
      "endSeconds": 250,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 5.311995,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_nsdr_600_6.m4a",
      "sha256": "d0e1547c3c159f5a7c9006694e61cef76a24a490dfff10ab0454dd921fbee5f8",
      "postEncodeGainDB": 0.8299999999999983
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_nsdr_600_7",
      "text": "腹部不用收紧。让腰腹得到支撑，随着自然呼吸轻轻移动。",
      "windowSeconds": 40,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 250,
      "endSeconds": 290,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 6.519002,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_nsdr_600_7.m4a",
      "sha256": "a3d8a15f3b22f8ebc65435ef12a2796a92fe26aaafa1ab86e5a8b05dc51afc61",
      "postEncodeGainDB": 0.46000000000000085
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_nsdr_600_8",
      "text": "感受骨盆与垫子接触的位置，把重量放下。",
      "windowSeconds": 40,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 290,
      "endSeconds": 330,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 4.418005,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_nsdr_600_8.m4a",
