      "text": "注意大腿和小腿。让双腿休息，不用主动绷直。",
      "windowSeconds": 80,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 640,
      "endSeconds": 720,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 5.7,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_nsdr_1200_9.m4a",
      "sha256": "32f70e34ae54533e422ec2b3cc0d48361cdc04d331a6fc6858c122c13fcc0d0e",
      "postEncodeGainDB": 0
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_nsdr_1200_10",
      "text": "脚踝放松，脚趾松开。感受双脚也被托住。",
      "windowSeconds": 90,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 720,
      "endSeconds": 810,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 5.41,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_nsdr_1200_10.m4a",
      "sha256": "db0a85b6395a1288511e4f4309ede3878bf95fd6878e8fbdb3453d5e51a328b2",
      "postEncodeGainDB": -0.5300000000000011
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_nsdr_1200_11",
      "text": "从头到脚感受整个身体。让支撑面接住你的重量。",
      "windowSeconds": 90,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 810,
      "endSeconds": 900,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 5.916009,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_nsdr_1200_11.m4a",
      "sha256": "5f35d5057841418b72364311f2ff5d5e80f5ad23213f418a9daed51cdced2b4c",
      "postEncodeGainDB": -0.8099999999999987
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_nsdr_1200_12",
      "text": "留意呼吸，也留意身体与垫子的接触。现在不用做更多事情。",
      "windowSeconds": 100,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 900,
      "endSeconds": 1000,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 6.6,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_nsdr_1200_12.m4a",
      "sha256": "fc6ff1aabbb874057a51f829efaa1e824371be99a43a913c89771526d0751cef",
      "postEncodeGainDB": 0
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_nsdr_1200_13",
      "text": "接下来安静待一会儿。念头出现，就让它过去。",
      "windowSeconds": 100,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 1000,
      "endSeconds": 1100,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 5.0,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_nsdr_1200_13.m4a",
      "sha256": "5fd98fa6b4d734fa9331aca5b7d6d63b0d2a5d623294bdccade3e5f6dc84dd6f",
      "postEncodeGainDB": 0
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_nsdr_1200_14",
      "text": "再感受一次整个身体。保持舒服的姿势，先不用起身。",
      "windowSeconds": 70,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 1100,
      "endSeconds": 1170,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 6.013991,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_nsdr_1200_14.m4a",
      "sha256": "8b1d4162fe72d90147ccdb98d2e540cae2045e752b1eb74592e022a5d1ffd0d8",
      "postEncodeGainDB": 0.9899999999999984
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_nsdr_1200_15",
      "text": "轻轻动动手指和脚趾。感受身边的空间，准备好时慢慢睁开眼睛。",
      "windowSeconds": 30,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 1170,
      "endSeconds": 1200,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 7.6,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_nsdr_1200_15.m4a",
      "sha256": "db9e3061cf23115d29f58d2856cba6f169c4de9aa6290ea037a8bc07c2d3f243",
      "postEncodeGainDB": 0
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_meditation_300_0",
      "text": "找一个舒服、能坐稳的姿势。把手自然放好。",
      "windowSeconds": 25,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 0,
      "endSeconds": 25,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 5.2,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_meditation_300_0.m4a",
      "sha256": "a7bafe027c6c7fbfdc783f7aca8c7807cab6fb46fc246b3041adb3dcb8d5d49a",
      "postEncodeGainDB": 0
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_meditation_300_1",
      "text": "感觉身体与椅子或垫子接触，先在这里停一下。",
      "windowSeconds": 30,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 25,
      "endSeconds": 55,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 4.901995,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_meditation_300_1.m4a",
      "sha256": "f2fa12e08058b18f405a0267f73def103e51265e96baeb33f3dd7106d2a7397c",
      "postEncodeGainDB": 0.8399999999999999
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_meditation_300_2",
      "text": "留意一口自然的呼吸。让呼吸按自己的节奏发生。",
      "windowSeconds": 45,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 55,
      "endSeconds": 100,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 5.507007,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_meditation_300_2.m4a",
      "sha256": "ed7926d1309a4f92a8df756d9334f9d7c8375a1455f465a18d084d23ca5a3195",
      "postEncodeGainDB": 0.6099999999999994
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_meditation_300_3",
      "text": "发现走神，就把注意力轻轻带回这一口呼吸。",
      "windowSeconds": 45,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 100,
      "endSeconds": 145,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 4.903991,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_meditation_300_3.m4a",
      "sha256": "f9f240e5b04babf7166d134487a0decb9392588dddfe1b861e28eedaf167ccfe",
      "postEncodeGainDB": 0.8000000000000007
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_meditation_300_4",
      "text": "念头可以来，也可以走。暂时不用跟着它继续想。",
      "windowSeconds": 55,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 145,
      "endSeconds": 200,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 5.602993,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_meditation_300_4.m4a",
      "sha256": "f5927287b10e8ced5a4960fd1eeaffaf4ff32dfc86d789a2e569867d8e42527a",
      "postEncodeGainDB": -0.28000000000000114
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_meditation_300_5",
      "text": "再感觉一次身体被托住。把注意力带回此刻。",
      "windowSeconds": 60,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 200,
      "endSeconds": 260,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 5.312993,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_meditation_300_5.m4a",
      "sha256": "8c5dbb4f6176c6bd1fb877b865dccab34d7e089c22734fe3b59b3afbe448846c",
      "postEncodeGainDB": -0.3099999999999987
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_meditation_300_6",
      "text": "留意接下来的几口自然呼吸。",
      "windowSeconds": 25,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 260,
      "endSeconds": 285,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "durationSeconds": 3.210998,
      "tempoAdjustment": 1,
      "file": "InnerBalance/InnerBalanceApp/PracticeVoice/practice_v4_meditation_300_6.m4a",
      "sha256": "48badf50f66e1faea0e9f20c9ca91895544f74a35416cde55261d8904a466e5b",
      "postEncodeGainDB": -0.3999999999999986
    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_meditation_300_7",
      "text": "感受身边的声音，轻轻动动手。准备好后，带着这份注意继续今天。",
