    },
    {
      "resource": "practice_v4_diaphragmaticBreathing_300_1",
      "text": "吸气时，感觉下肋和腹部轻轻展开。肩膀不需要抬起来。",
      "windowSeconds": 30,
      "type": "segment",
      "startSeconds": 30,
